# Explorer backend inputs, local Compose defaults and production source defaults.
# Secrets are empty; commented entries stay unset or use a computed default.
# Supply database connections, node endpoints and signing material for the
# enabled features. HTTP request endpoints and WebSocket subscriptions are
# separate settings. CHAIN_TYPE and ETHEREUM_JSONRPC_VARIANT select paxeer_x
# for the merged network. Local Compose values apply to its configured inputs;
# other entries list the production source defaults. Compile-time settings
# take effect when the backend is compiled.

